comments.body:
@ErickRosas Thanks for your contribution. We translate xDrip using the semi-automated workflow system of [crowdin](https://crowdin.com). Please create an account at crowdin and add your suggestions there. Then, they will go through the translation workflow including proof reading.
Please report back here, when you are done and close this issue.

Regarding to the fixed strings inside javascript, please create an issue for that and link to the corresponding code lines. That would be really helpful and easier to address.
